l,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Section 1. Order of Succession. Subject to the provisions of section 2 of \nthis order, and to the limitations set forth in the Act, the following officials \nof the Department of Homeland Security, in the order listed, shall act as \nand perform the functions and duties of the office of Secretary of Homeland \nSecurity (Secretary) during any period in which the Secretary, the Deputy \nSecretary of Homeland Security, the Under Secretary for Management, and \nany officers designated by the Secretary pursuant to 6 U.S.C. 113 to act \nas Secretary have died, resigned, or otherwise become unable to perform \nthe functions and duties of the office of Secretary, until such time as at \nleast one of the officers mentioned above is able to perform the functions \nand duties of that office:","original_source":{"page_or_item":"90 FR 2579, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 1 (lead-in)","sha256":"3edf69087102c01e0d98b85b0c9bcbc4456c8fdd96c99d0d15fc3b1578d2d501","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-13/pdf/2025-00603.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14135#sec1","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) Administrator of the Transportation Security Administration;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"90 FR 2579, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 1(a)","sha256":"3edf69087102c01e0d98b85b0c9bcbc4456c8fdd96c99d0d15fc3b1578d2d501","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-13/pdf/2025-00603.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14135#sec1(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) Under Secretary for Intelligence and Analysis;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"90 FR 2579, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 1(b)","sha256":"3edf69087102c01e0d98b85b0c9bcbc4456c8fdd96c99d0d15fc3b1578d2d501","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-13/pdf/2025-00603.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14135#sec1(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(c) Director of the Federal Law Enforcement Training Centers; and","original_source":{"page_or_item":"90 FR 2579, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 1(c)","sha256":"3edf69087102c01e0d98b85b0c9bcbc4456c8fdd96c99d0d15fc3b1578d2d501","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-13/pdf/2025-00603.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14135#sec1(c)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(d) Region 3 Administrator, Federal Emergency Management Agency.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"90 FR 2579, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 1(d)","sha256":"3edf69087102c01e0d98b85b0c9bcbc4456c8fdd96c99d0d15fc3b1578d2d501","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-13/pdf/2025-00603.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14135#sec1(d)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) No individual who is serving in an office listed \nin section 1(a)–(d) of this order in an acting capacity shall, by virtue of \nso serving, act as Secretary pursuant to this order.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"90 FR 2579, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 2(a)","sha256":"3edf69087102c01e0d98b85b0c9bcbc4456c8fdd96c99d0d15fc3b1578d2d501","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-13/pdf/2025-00603.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14135#sec2(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) No individual who is serving in an office listed in section 1(a)– \n(d) of this order shall act as Secretary pursuant to this order unless that \nindividual is otherwise eligible to so serve under the Act.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"90 FR 2579, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 2(b)","sha256":"3edf69087102c01e0d98b85b0c9bcbc4456c8fdd96c99d0d15fc3b1578d2d501","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2025-01-13/pdf/2025-00603.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:14135#sec2(b)","state_at_cutoff":